      "message": "Just FYI, Mesa does call into `ALOGE(..)` under the hood:\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/hardware/google/gfxstream/+/refs/heads/main/guest/mesa/src/util/log.c#284\n\nWhy Mesa `mesa_log()` over `gfxstream_log` (at-least guest side)?  Since we want move gfxstream VK into Mesa for Linux/Fuchsia reasons, and `mesa_log(.)` is preferred method in that code base.",
